Chocolate brown is not just trending. It is the shade stylists mention first when a client asks what to book, worn as a single rich coat, layered tonally finger to finger, or matte for a suede-like finish that photographs beautifully. On shorter nails, one clean coat of mocha does more work than people expect. It reads intentional, not like an afterthought.

