### Cat Claw Nail Shape

A cat claw, sometimes called a wolf claw, is an extremely curved stiletto extension that tapers to a sharp point, built with gel or acrylic. It is the most editorial choice fall 2026 has to offer and the one entry on this list about shape rather than colour or finish, time-intensive to sculpt and not offered by every tech yet.

