## Fall Nail Ideas by Nail Shape

Almond is the shape doing most of the visual work across this entire season's <strong>fall nail ideas</strong>, and there is a real reason beyond preference. The tapered point elongates the nail bed just enough that darker colours read richer, and it is one of the few shapes flexible enough to carry both a solid jewel tone and detailed art like tortoiseshell without either fighting the shape.

Square is the other shape earning serious attention this year, particularly on shorter lengths. A solid, uninterrupted colour, no art, no accents, reads bold and clean on square nails in a way it can look plain on other shapes, since the flat edge gives a single colour nowhere to lose its line. Coffin remains the choice for anyone wanting maximum canvas for detailed nail art, tortoiseshell and mix-and-match sets in particular benefit from the extra surface a coffin shape provides.

